) VALUES (
    'kitzbuehel-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Kitzbühel: Home of the Legendary Hahnenkamm", "de": "Kitzbühel: Heimat des legendären Hahnenkamms", "fr": "Kitzbühel : Terre du légendaire Hahnenkamm", "it": "Kitzbühel: Casa del leggendario Hahnenkamm", "es": "Kitzbühel: Hogar del legendario Hahnenkamm", "pt": "Kitzbühel: Lar do lendário Hahnenkamm", "nl": "Kitzbühel: Thuis van de legendarische Hahnenkamm", "ar": "كيتزبوهيل: موطن هانينكام الأسطوري", "ja": "キッツビュール：伝説のハーネンカムの本拠地", "zh": "Kitzbuehel: Chuanqi Hahnenkamm de Jiayuan", "ko": "키츠뷔엘: 전설적인 하넨캄의 본거지"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Streif downhill at Kitzbühel is the most famous and feared race in alpine skiing. This Austrian resort hosts the sport''s most prestigious annual event.", "de": "Die Streif-Abfahrt in Kitzbühel ist das berühmteste und gefürchtetste Rennen im Ski Alpin.", "fr": "La descente de la Streif à Kitzbühel est la course la plus célèbre et redoutée du ski alpin.", "it": "La discesa della Streif a Kitzbühel è la gara più famosa e temuta dello sci alpino.", "es": "El descenso de la Streif en Kitzbühel es la carrera más famosa y temida del esquí alpino.", "pt": "A descida da Streif em Kitzbühel é a corrida mais famosa e temida do esqui alpino.", "nl": "De Streif afdaling in Kitzbühel is de meest beroemde en gevreesde race in de alpine ski.", "ar": "سباق انحدار شترايف في كيتزبوهيل هو أشهر وأرهب سباق في التزلج الألبي", "ja": "キッツビュールのシュトライフ・ダウンヒルは、アルペンスキーで最も有名で恐れられているレースです。", "zh": "Kitzbuehel de Streif huajiang shi gaoshan huaxue zhong zui zhiming ye zui ke pa de bisai.", "ko": "키츠뷔엘의 슈트라이프 활강은 알파인 스키에서 가장 유명하고 두려운 레이스입니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Kitzbühel''s Hahnenkamm weekend represents the pinnacle of World Cup <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiing</a>. The Streif downhill course is universally regarded as the ultimate test of speed skiing ability and courage.</p><h2>The Streif</h2><p>The Streif is not just a ski race - it''s a phenomenon. The course features an 85% gradient at the Mausefalle, speeds exceeding 140 km/h, and technical sections that require perfect execution. One mistake can end a race or a season.</p><p>The Mausefalle (Mousetrap) pitch is so steep that skiers are essentially in free fall for a brief moment. The compression at the bottom creates enormous forces on athletes'' bodies.</p><h2>Racing History</h2><p>The Hahnenkamm races have been held since 1931, creating nearly a century of tradition. Winning on the Streif places an athlete in an exclusive club of skiing legends.</p><p>Champions like <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> and <a href=\"/marco-schwarz-profile/\">Marco Schwarz</a> have conquered this mountain.</p><h2>The Weekend</h2><p>Hahnenkamm weekend typically includes a super-G and slalom in addition to the legendary downhill. The entire town transforms into a skiing celebration, with fans traveling from across Europe and beyond.</p><h2>Atmosphere</h2><p>The finish area at Kitzbühel creates an atmosphere unlike anywhere else in skiing. The grandstands packed with fans, the traditional Austrian music, and the knowledge that history is being made combine to produce unforgettable moments.</p><h2>The Town</h2><p>Kitzbühel is a charming medieval town with excellent hotels, restaurants, and shopping. The après-ski scene is legendary in its own right, with celebrations continuing long after the last racer crosses the finish line.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>The resort is easily accessible from Salzburg Airport (about 80 km) or Innsbruck Airport. Train connections are also excellent.</p>", "de": "<p>Das Hahnenkamm-Wochenende in Kitzbühel repräsentiert den Höhepunkt des Weltcup-<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">Ski Alpins</a>. Die Streif-Abfahrt gilt universell als ultimativer Test für Speed-Ski-Fähigkeiten und Mut.</p><h2>Die Streif</h2><p>Die Streif ist nicht nur ein Skirennen - sie ist ein Phänomen. Die Strecke weist ein Gefälle von 85% bei der Mausefalle auf, Geschwindigkeiten über 140 km/h und technische Abschnitte, die perfekte Ausführung erfordern.</p><h2>Renngeschichte</h2><p>Die Hahnenkamm-Rennen werden seit 1931 ausgetragen. Champions wie <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> haben diesen Berg bezwungen.</p><h2>Die Stadt</h2><p>Kitzbühel ist eine charmante mittelalterliche Stadt mit ausgezeichneten Hotels und Restaurants.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le week-end du Hahnenkamm à Kitzbühel représente le summum de la Coupe du monde de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">ski alpin</a>. La descente de la Streif est universellement considérée comme le test ultime.</p><h2>La Streif</h2><p>La Streif n''est pas qu''une course de ski - c''est un phénomène. Le parcours présente une pente de 85% à la Mausefalle, des vitesses dépassant 140 km/h et des sections techniques exigeant une exécution parfaite.</p><h2>Histoire des courses</h2><p>Les courses du Hahnenkamm ont lieu depuis 1931. Des champions comme <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> ont conquis cette montagne.</p>", "it": "<p>Il fine settimana dell''Hahnenkamm a Kitzbühel rappresenta il culmine della Coppa del Mondo di <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">sci alpino</a>. La discesa della Streif è universalmente considerata il test definitivo.</p><h2>La Streif</h2><p>La Streif non è solo una gara di sci - è un fenomeno. Il percorso presenta una pendenza dell''85% alla Mausefalle, velocità superiori a 140 km/h e sezioni tecniche che richiedono esecuzione perfetta.</p><h2>Storia delle gare</h2><p>Le gare dell''Hahnenkamm si tengono dal 1931. Campioni come <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a> hanno conquistato questa montagna.</p>", "es": "<p>El fin de semana del Hahnenkamm en Kitzbühel representa la cima de la Copa del Mundo de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esquí alpino</a>. El descenso de la Streif es universalmente considerado como la prueba definitiva.</p><h2>La Streif</h2><p>La Streif no es solo una carrera de esquí - es un fenómeno. El recorrido presenta una pendiente del 85% en la Mausefalle, velocidades superiores a 140 km/h.</p>", "pt": "<p>O fim de semana do Hahnenkamm em Kitzbühel representa o auge da Copa do Mundo de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esqui alpino</a>. A descida da Streif é universalmente considerada como o teste definitivo.</p><h2>A Streif</h2><p>A Streif não é apenas uma corrida de esqui - é um fenômeno.</p>", "nl": "<p>Het Hahnenkamm weekend in Kitzbühel vertegenwoordigt het hoogtepunt van de Wereldbeker <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiën</a>. De Streif afdaling wordt universeel beschouwd als de ultieme test.</p><h2>De Streif</h2><p>De Streif is niet zomaar een skirace - het is een fenomeen.</p>", "ar": "<p>يمثل عطلة نهاية أسبوع هانينكام في كيتزبوهيل قمة كأس العالم <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">للتزلج الألبي</a>. يعتبر انحدار شترايف عالمياً الاختبار النهائي.</p><h2>شترايف</h2><p>شترايف ليس مجرد سباق تزلج - إنه ظاهرة.</p>", "ja": "<p>キッツビュールのハーネンカム週末は、ワールドカップ<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>の頂点を代表します。シュトライフダウンヒルコースは、スピードスキー能力と勇気の究極のテストとして普遍的に認識されています。</p><h2>シュトライフ</h2><p>シュトライフは単なるスキーレースではありません - それは現象です。</p>", "zh": "<p>Kitzbuehel de Hahnenkamm zhoumo daibiao Shijie Bei <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">gaoshan huaxue</a> de dianfeng. Streif huajiang saidao bei pubianrenwei shi sudu huaxue nengli he yongqi de zhongji kaoyan.</p><h2>Streif</h2><p>Streif bujinshi yici huaxue bisai - ta shi yige xianxiang.</p>", "ko": "<p>키츠뷔엘의 하넨캄 주말은 월드컵 <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a>의 정점을 대표합니다. 슈트라이프 활강 코스는 스피드 스키 능력과 용기의 궁극적인 테스트로 보편적으로 인정됩니다.</p><h2>슈트라이프</h2><p>슈트라이프는 단순한 스키 레이스가 아닙니다 - 그것은 현상입니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "Kitzbühel venue guide - Home of the legendary Streif downhill, the most famous and demanding race in World Cup alpine skiing history.", "de": "Kitzbühel Venue Guide - Heimat der legendären Streif-Abfahrt, des berühmtesten Rennens im Weltcup-Ski-Alpin.", "fr": "Guide du site de Kitzbühel - Terre de la légendaire descente de la Streif, la course la plus célèbre du ski alpin.", "it": "Guida alla sede di Kitzbühel - Casa della leggendaria discesa della Streif, la gara più famosa dello sci alpino.", "es": "Guía del lugar de Kitzbühel - Hogar del legendario descenso de la Streif, la carrera más famosa del esquí alpino.", "pt": "Guia do local de Kitzbühel - Lar da lendária descida da Streif, a corrida mais famosa do esqui alpino.", "nl": "Kitzbühel locatiegids - Thuis van de legendarische Streif afdaling, de beroemdste race in de alpine ski.", "ar": "دليل موقع كيتزبوهيل - موطن انحدار شترايف الأسطوري، أشهر سباق في التزلج الألبي", "ja": "キッツビュール会場ガイド - 伝説的なシュトライフダウンヒルの本拠地、アルペンスキー史上最も有名なレース", "zh": "Kitzbuehel changguan zhinan - Chuanqi Streif huajiang de jiayuan, gaoshan huaxue lishi shang zui zhiming de bisai", "ko": "키츠뷔엘 경기장 가이드 - 전설적인 슈트라이프 활강의 본거지, 알파인 스키 역사상 가장 유명한 레이스"}'::jsonb,
